MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Kai: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Kai_001: 媽媽………………
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Dit: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Dit_001: ………………呵呵，\n哈哈哈、哈――哈哈哈哈……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Seo: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Seo_001: ………………\n我們的怨恨……絕不會消失……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Led: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Led_001: ………………\n我……究竟是為了什麼……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Lin: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Lin_001: 怎……麼……會……？
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_04_Gol: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_04_Gol_001: 這、這不可能……\n俺竟然會……
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_05_Zac: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_05_Zac_001: 我……竟然……輸了！？\n輸、輸給這群貨色……？
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_06_Ven: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_06_Ven_001: ……我……成為大將軍的夢想……\n怎……怎麼能放棄……現在還不行……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_07_Nuz: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_07_Nuz_001: 不會吧……\n竟然打敗了我……
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_09_Ini: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_09_Ini_001: ……不……不可能。\n擁有這把弓的我……應該是無敵的……
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_09_Kou: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_09_Kou_001: ………………可惡，\n拉苦裟大人……我很抱歉……
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_10_Led: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_10_Led_001: 不會……吧……？\n我竟然……？
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_10_Buc: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_10_Buc_001: 到此為止了嗎……\n很……遺憾……
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_11_Znz: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_11_Znz_001: 可、可惡……\n你憑什麼做這麼過分的事……
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_12_Seo: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_12_Seo_001: 我……竟然會輸？\n不，現在還沒有……
MID_EV_DIE_BD11_12_Seo: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_BD11_12_Seo_001: 我……\n要為了……薩拉彌斯的……宿願……
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_13_Har: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_13_Har_001: 明……明明只差\n這麼……一點點而已……
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_13_Ger: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_13_Ger_001: 不、不要啊……\n我已經不想再回到牢房裡了……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_14_Cas: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_14_Cas_001: ……身體、已經動不了啊。\n似乎……有點太亂來了……
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_14_Cas_Kai: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_14_Cas_Kai_001: 凱伊……真是的，\n居然變得這麼厲害了……
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_14_Bel: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_14_Bel_001: 居然能打倒我……\n厲……害……
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_01_Sem: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_01_Sem_001: 吼――――！
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Anh: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Anh_001: 唔……！\n但……我還能戰鬥……！
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Sar: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Sar_001: 糟了……\n沒想到我竟然會……！
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Naz: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Naz_001: 可惡……給我記住，\n下次我絕對不會輸的……！
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Dai: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Dai_001: 唔喔喔，俺被幹掉了！？\n這些傢伙，不一般啊！
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Hal: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Hal_001: 啊哇哇哇哇……\n我不行了，救命啊――！哎呀呀！
MID_EV_DIE_BD12_04_Maj: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_BD12_04_Maj_001: 真、真的假的……？\n我馬吉迪大人竟然會被……
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_09_Ale: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_09_Ale_001: 真……\n真是……厲害……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_10_Hri: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_10_Hri_001: 我竟然會失敗……\n……真是相當強勁的對手……
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_10_Nat: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_10_Nat_001: 居然可以擋下我的全力攻擊……\n厲害……
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_12_Ket: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_12_Ket_001: 喔喔――――\n………………
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_14_Conlon: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_14_Conlon_001: 呀啊啊啊！
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_14_Zen: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_14_Zen_001: 咳……呃……\n大家……抱歉……
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_15_Anh: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_15_Anh_001: 怎……怎麼會！？\n身為調停者的我竟然……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_16_Bel: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_16_Bel_001: 居然能打倒我……\n厲……害……
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_17_Mar: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_17_Mar_001: ……原來如此，以人類來說表現得還挺出色的……！\n真不愧是大賽優勝者――！
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_17_MarD: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_17_MarD_001: ……厲害。\n但若想打倒我，力量還遠遠不足……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_00_Baa: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_00_Baa_001: 女人……你的臉和那隻手臂……\n我會記住的……
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC13_01_Hoo: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC13_01_Hoo_001: 賽奧朵拉殿下……\n我……甘拜下風……
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_01_Day: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_01_Day_001: 你、你這傢伙……\n竟敢讓我……面子掃地……
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_04_MysteryMan: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_04_MysteryMan_001: 可惡……\n但這點程度是阻止不了我的……！
MID_EV_RETREAT_BD13_05_Baa: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_BD13_05_Baa_001: 嘎嘎嘎……\n嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎……
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_07_Baa: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_07_Baa_001: 即使……肉體消滅了……\n我的……靈魂也不會……
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_09_Nuz: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_09_Nuz_001: 對我們來說……\n安居之地……已化為泡影……
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_13_Day: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_13_Day_001: 竟然一而再、再而三落入你們手中……\n真是……屈辱……！
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC13_13_Kra: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC13_13_Kra_001: 可惡，果然……那傢伙對我們來說……\n就是個瘟神啊……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_00_Bjo: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_00_Bjo_001: 可……可惡……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_01_Bol: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_01_Bol_001: 不……不可能的……\n這種事竟然會發生在我身上……
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_03_Oly: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_03_Oly_001: 唔……果然很有本事呢。\n但是，這還沒結束！
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_06_Jas: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_06_Jas_001: 唔唔……\n是我輸了嗎……
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_09_Lec: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_09_Lec_001: 可惡……\n竟然侮辱我「瘋狗」到這個程度……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_09_Mra: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_09_Mra_001: ……還挺厲害的嘛。\n我好像有點小看你們了呢。
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_12_Kai: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_12_Kai_001: 可惡……\n看來……沒這麼順利啊……
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_12_Buc: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_12_Buc_001: 到此為止了嗎……\n很……遺憾……
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_13_Seo: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_13_Seo_001: 沒想到……\n居然能讓我雙膝跪地……
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_14_Qui: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_14_Qui_001: ………………
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_14_Mra: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_14_Mra_001: 召喚冥界消耗我太多力量了。\n似乎該撤退了呢……
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_15_Bel: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_15_Bel_001: ……挺有本事的！\n但是，還沒結束……！
