MID_EV_DIE_SC18_13_Shi_001: 
MID_EV_DIE_SC18_14_Dit: 
MID_EV_DIE_SC18_14_Dit_001: 
MID_EV_DIE_SC18_14_Fab: 
MID_EV_DIE_SC18_14_Fab_001: 
MID_EV_DIE_BD18_15_Ile: 
MID_EV_DIE_BD18_15_Ile_001: 
MID_EV_DIE_SC18_16_Bel: 
MID_EV_DIE_SC18_16_Bel_001: 
MID_EV_DIE_SC18_17_Shi: 
MID_EV_DIE_SC18_17_Shi_001: 
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_00_Kai: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_00_Kai_001: 媽媽、老爸，對不起……\n我已經回不去了……
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_00_Led: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_00_Led_001: 還沒……結束……\n我絕不能……倒在……這種地方……
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_00_Nat: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_00_Nat_001: 戰況有些不利啊……\n這裡就先撤退吧。
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_00_Hri: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_00_Hri_001: 原來如此……的確是很有實力。\n說要對抗神威大帝，也不是誇大其辭呢……
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_00_Jan: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_00_Jan_001: 唔……今天只是狀態不好！\n老夫真正的實力還不只如此！
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_00_Lin: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_00_Lin_001: ……看來我好像有點\n誤判了你們的實力……
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_01_Hri: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_01_Hri_001: 呼……果然這裡就是……\n我的葬身之地嗎……
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_01_Nat: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_01_Nat_001: 可惡……我大意了嗎……\n但是，我還不能倒下……！
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_01_Nat_002: 齊利科……\n聽好了，你絕對不能死掉……
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_01_Jan: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_01_Jan_001: 這、這不是逃跑！\n這只是――戰略性撤退！！
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_01_Lin: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_01_Lin_001: ……原來如此，\n之前的勝利看來並不是僥倖呢……
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_03_Nat: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_03_Nat_001: 貝特蘭王……亞絲望王后……\n這個國家的未來……就拜託了……
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_03_Nat_002: ……齊利科……是你嗎？\n別笑我了……我已經盡力了……
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_03_Gil: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_03_Gil_001: 可惡……我……\n又要……輸了……嗎……
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_03_Gil_002: ……咳呃！\n我的生命要……就此完結了……嗎？
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_03_Gil_003: ………………咦？\n吉爾奇魯斯……兄長大人……？
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_03_Gil_004: 我……我……\n我究竟……做了什麼……？
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_05_Tal: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_05_Tal_001: 錯估……情勢……了嗎……\n這一點……都不像……我的作風……
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_05_Lin: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_05_Lin_001: 我的……願望……已經無法實現了嗎……\n我好悔恨啊……母親大人……
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_06_Dit: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_06_Dit_001: ………………\n樂趣……就在這裡……
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_06_Dag: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_06_Dag_001: ……唔！？\n竟被區區人類……
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_06_Dag_002: 嗚哇啊啊啊啊啊！\n不、不可能……這絕對不可能……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_06_Dag: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_06_Dag_001: ……唔……\n好像……有點本事……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_06_DagD: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_06_DagD_001: 不……不可能！\n這麼荒謬的事……不可能發生！
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_07_Znz: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_07_Znz_001: 快住手……不要搶走……\n這可是我的……樂園啊……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_07_Bol: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_07_Bol_001: ………………\n難道我……選錯路……了嗎？
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_07_Jan: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_07_Jan_001: ……這絕對不是……敗北……！\n霸羅爾大人，懇請原諒……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_07_Dit: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_07_Dit_001: ………………
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_07_Bre: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_07_Bre_001: 竟然能把我……逼到絕境……\n原來如此……看來並非……一無是處啊……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_13_Anh: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_13_Anh_001: ………………\n怎麼……會……這樣……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_13_Shi: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_13_Shi_001: 絕不承認……\n我們絕對不會承認敗北的……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_08_Bel: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_08_Bel_001: ………………
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_08_Cir: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_08_Cir_001: 運氣……很差啊……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_08_Che: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_08_Che_001: 哎呀……？\n運氣不好的……好像是我呢……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_08_Ara: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_08_Ara_001: 我竟然……輸了……？\n……身體要崩壞了……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_08_Hno: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_08_Hno_001: 不可能……我的……王國在逐漸崩潰……\n化作沙石……化為塵土……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_11_Kai: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_11_Kai_001: 我的……身體開始崩壞了……\n這可不行……我明明還能繼續戰鬥……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_11_Har: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_11_Har_001: 蓋爾巴希歐……\n你在哪裡……在哪裡啊……？
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_11_Bou: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_11_Bou_001: ……快住手……\n不要……把我溶化掉……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_11_Hyo: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_11_Hyo_001: 還……還沒結束……\n我還沒有……落敗啊……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_09_Tal: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_09_Tal_001: ………………可惡，\n真……無聊……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_09_Gil: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_09_Gil_001: 啊啊……義母……\n你在哪裡，義母……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_09_Ban: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_09_Ban_001: ……為什麼……\n要阻礙……我……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_09_Baa: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_09_Baa_001: 嘎嘎嘎……嘎嘎嘎嘎……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_09_Dra: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_09_Dra_001: 唔……我……我竟然輸了……\n不可能啊啊啊啊……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_10_Seo: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_10_Seo_001: 給我記住……我們的怨念……\n永遠都不會消失……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_10_Day: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_10_Day_001: 住手……拜託住手……\n別再次……殺掉我了……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_10_Mhm: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_10_Mhm_001: 唔唔唔唔……！\n厲……厲害……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Led: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Led_001: ………………怎麼……\n可能……接受……這種事……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Mra: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Mra_001: 你這……無禮之徒……\n到最後一刻都……別……別開玩笑……了……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Mra_002: ……晚安，母親。
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Mra_003: 啊啊……父親大人……\n………………
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Man: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Man_001: ………………
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Qui: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Qui_001: 想不起來……\n什麼都……我什麼都……想不起來……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Lec: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Lec_001: ………………
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Coh: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Coh_001: 我竟然會被……逼上絕路……\n被這種程度的傢伙……！
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_14_Lyr: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_14_Lyr_001: 阻止不了……他們嗎……\n父親大人……萬分抱歉……
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_15_Bal: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_15_Bal_001: 唔……\n我霸羅爾……冥界之王竟然會……
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Kai: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Kai_001: 我跑去救老爸，自己卻倒下了，\n媽媽一定會生氣吧……
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Dit: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Dit_001: 唔……！到此為止了嗎……！
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Dit_002: 迪托利希先生！\n都怪我……！
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Seo: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Seo_001: 我誤判了嗎……
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Seo_002: 賽奧朵拉姐姐！\n都怪我……！
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Led: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Led_001: 騙人的吧……\n我竟然會被……
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Led_002: 蕾達姐姐！\n都怪我……！
