MID_DIE_SCXX_01_Dit_001: 到此為止了嗎……
MID_DIE_SCXX_01_Kai: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_01_Kai_001: 嗚哇……！\n不行，我還沒……！
MID_DIE_SCXX_01_Kai_002: 唔……！\n凱伊……
MID_DIE_SCXX_01_Seo: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_01_Seo_001: 我誤判了嗎……
MID_DIE_SCXX_01_Seo_002: 唔……！\n賽奧朵拉……
