MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Seo: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Seo_001: 我的武藝、我的信念，\n必須能讓勇士引以為傲才行……！
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Kai: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Kai_001: 嗚哇……！\n不行，我還沒……！
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Kai_002: 凱伊！\n抱歉……
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Dit: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Dit_001: 唔……！到此為止了嗎……！
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Dit_002: 迪托利希！\n抱歉……
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Led: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Led_001: 騙人的吧……\n我竟然會被……
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Led_002: 蕾達！\n抱歉……
