MID_DIE_SCXX_07_Anh: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_07_Anh_001: 我絕對不能死……\n要是我在這裡倒下了，誰來守護大家……！
MID_DIE_SCXX_07_Kai: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_07_Kai_001: 嗚哇……！\n不行，我還沒……！
MID_DIE_SCXX_07_Kai_002: 凱伊！\n對不起……
MID_DIE_SCXX_07_Dit: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_07_Dit_001: 唔……！到此為止了嗎……！
MID_DIE_SCXX_07_Dit_002: 迪托利希！\n對不起……
